@startuml T04-05 院校查询活动图
' 图源：docs/coursework-02/system/uml/T04-05_院校查询活动图.puml
' 渲染：java -jar plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tpng 本文件（活动图不依赖 Graphviz）
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F7FAFD
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #3C5A80
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8E6
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #8A6D1F

|学生|
start
:进入院校页;
|前端|
:并发请求 GET /api/schools/options\n与 GET /api/schools;
|Java 后端|
:查询院校库：省份、层次精确匹配，\n专业名对 school_detail 模糊匹配;
|MySQL|
:school LEFT JOIN school_detail\nSELECT DISTINCT s.*，ORDER BY s.id;
|前端|
:展示院校列表与筛选项;
|学生|
:按省份／层次／专业名筛选;
|前端|
:GET /api/schools?province&level&majorName;
|Java 后端|
:返回过滤结果（不分页、无匹配分）;
|学生|
:点击院校查看详情;
|前端|
:GET /api/schools/{id};
|Java 后端|
if (院校存在？) then (否)
  :返回 404 院校不存在;
  stop
endif
:读取专业详情（按年份降序）\n补充招生指标与口径提醒;
:返回 school＋details＋warnings;
|前端|
:展示院校、专业、年份与来源;
|学生|
:查看具体专业与往年指标;
stop
@enduml
